Downloads.Description:
@Arcade
<br />Adds app icons for Prairie King and Junimo Kart to the Mobile Phone mod.
<br />Updated version of Mobile Arcade (https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6538)

@BalloonRide
<br />Allows you to invite any villager you are dating on a balloon ride, by calling them on the Mobile Phone.
<br />Updated version of Balloon Ride (https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6633)

@TV
<br /><br />Adds a television app to the mobile phone that lets you access your tv channels from anywhere.
<br /><br />Updated version of Mobile Television (https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6575)
